			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 751080101,
					"content": "We said we were going to cook, but what exactly should we make?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751080102,
					"content": "Hmm... We used to feed fish to the Blubberbeast Berrypuff, didn't we? In that case, a fish dish should do just fine!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751080103,
					"content": "#If we want the Blubberbeast and {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]} to eat well... Natlan's special Grilled Fish in Mint Sauce might be a pretty good choice.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080104,
						751080105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751080104,
					"content": "That's practically a specialty of mine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751080106,
					"content": "Alright, let's get started then. Paimon will give you some pointers while you're at it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080107,
						751080109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751080107,
					"content": "Make deeper cuts.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751080108,
					"content": "That's right! The deeper the cuts, the deeper the flavor seeps in!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080111,
						751080113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751080111,
					"content": "A little extra salt, a little extra happiness!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751080112,
					"content": "#Mmm, that sure tastes rich. {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]} and the Blubberbeast are going to love it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080115,
						751080117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751080115,
					"content": "Mint sauce. The more, the merrier.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080116
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751080116,
					"content": "Hehe, that refreshing, cool taste is going to be awesome!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080119,
						751080121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751080119,
					"content": "Chili peppers are indispensable.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080120
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751080120,
					"content": "Just the right amount of spiciness — enough to whet the appetite!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080123,
						751080125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751080123,
					"content": "Flame-grilled over scorching heat — crispy on the outside, tender on the inside!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751080124,
					"content": "Heehee, that sounds so delicious, Paimon's drooling already.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751080127,
					"content": "#After a splendid culinary process, the special fish you grilled for {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]} and the Blubberbeast is ready...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 751080125,
					"content": "Slow roasted — tender and juicy!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080126
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751080126,
					"content": "#Wow, amazing! {NICKNAME}'s secret art grilled fish... Maybe someday it'll become one of your specialties and you'll be able to cook it for our other friends!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751080121,
					"content": "Animals from Fontaine might be allergic to spicy food...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751080122,
					"content": "But it'd feel like something is missing if there's no chili at all, so why not add just a little?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080123,
						751080125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751080117,
					"content": "Will an aquatic animal like the Blubberbeast be afraid of mint?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080118
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751080118,
					"content": "That's not how that works. A Blubberbeast is going to find the surface dry and hot, so adding a little mint sauce ought to help it cool down, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080119,
						751080121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751080113,
					"content": "The flavor's great as-is. No need for any salt.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751080114,
					"content": "Yup. We've still got other seasonings, so we don't have to go so heavy on the salt.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080115,
						751080117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751080109,
					"content": "Make shallower cuts.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751080110,
					"content": "Not bad. It should keep the flavor light while maintaining the original fishiness — which the Blubberbeast is sure to love.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080111,
						751080113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751080105,
					"content": "Can't say I've perfected it, but no problem.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751080106
					]
				}
			]
		},
