					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751080505,
					"content": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]} listens intently to the cries of the Blubberbeast and, seemingly understanding something, lifts the creature by the tail to take it over to the shallows, where they play together.",
